<title>HONG KONG: HK provisional Aug-Oct unemployment 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Aug-Oct unemployment 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department gave on Monday the following seasonally adjusted figures as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Aug-Oct*  Jul-Sep   Apr-Jun   Jul-Sep</p>
<p>			 1996	1996	1996	1995</p>
<p> Unemployment	 2.6	 2.6	 3.1	 3.5</p>
<p> Underemployment    1.5	 1.4	 1.8	 2.5</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
